{'symbol': 'STE', 'date': '2022-05-04 16:30:00', 'title': 'STERIS DECLARES $0.43 PER SHARE DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DUBLIN, IRELAND , MAY 04, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0STERIS PLC (NYSE: STE) (“STERIS” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY WILL DISTRIBUTE A QUARTERLY INTERIM DIVIDEND OF $0.43 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JUNE 28, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 14, 2022.'}